      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "- `coastal-house.png`: Asset Library preview and local reference asset (1536 × 1024).\n- `mountain-study.png`: Original canvas artwork and local reference asset (1536 × 1024).\n- `playhead-marker.svg`: Original 22 × 26 playhead alpha mask.\n- `playhead-line.svg`: Original colored playhead layer, composed through the alpha mask by TimelineView.\n",
